{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20843","headline":"河南府试十二月乐词 四月 · 李贺","name":"河南府试十二月乐词 四月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓凉暮凉树如盖，千山浓绿生云外。\n依微香雨青氛氲，腻叶蟠花照曲门。\n金塘闲水摇碧漪，老景沈重无惊飞，堕红残萼暗参差。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20843.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20843","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}